      "mergedPostDetails": "Using a script and you can use the api via the selfinvite api and it enables you to be able to invite/create instances under any user or group even if you aren't in said group.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Instance Creation Abuse",
      "parentID": "6941b24184a2bffca8f28cce",
