      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> enables you to be able to invite/create instances under any user\n\nSince the introduction of [Secure Instances](https://hello.vrchat.com/blog/vrchat-security-update) in [VRChat 2022.2.2](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202222), you still need to be a friend of said user to create Friends+ instances under another user's name. This is intended.\n\nHowever, that update spoke nothing of Secure Instances for groups, because groups were released in [VRChat 2022.4.2](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202242) months later.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
