      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You also don't need to be a friend of the group owner to create group public instances of arbitrary groups, such as VRChat Team ([VRCHAT.0000](https://vrc.group/VRCHAT.0000)).\n\n(I dropped this portal to a world that's set private and low traffic.)",
